[{"id":943280666489257984,"date":1513730610000,"rawContent":"\u201cThe #MeToo moment is not a new moment. Women have had these conversations amongst themselves for a long time. It\u2019s just revolutionary for men\u201d - @JessicaValenti #GuardianLive","userId":105965228,"media":null,"username":"alisonturkos","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":1.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":29,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":11,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":1.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":943282883355119617,"date":1513731139000,"rawContent":"What happens to the stories of those whose abusers don\u2019t get thanked in Oscar speeches? Who aren\u2019t rich? Who aren\u2019t famous? Who aren\u2019t white? Who make less than minimum wage? Who are undocumented? #MeToo  #GuardianLive","userId":105965228,"media":null,"username":"alisonturkos","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":2.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":29,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":12,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":2.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":953048010858037248,"date":1516059327000,"rawContent":"When survivors ask for space to heal please respect that. \nSharing stories is exhausting in more ways than we\u2019ll ever know. \n#MeToo https:\/\/t.co\/57iRDR85tl","userId":105965228,"media":null,"username":"alisonturkos","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":3.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":29,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":13,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":3.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":960346989782355968,"date":1517799539000,"rawContent":"This entire thread is the most important thing you'll read today. People say \"don't let this define you\" but so often for survivors it can feel impossible not to. \n#MeToo https:\/\/t.co\/4jGat7m8au","userId":105965228,"media":null,"username":"alisonturkos","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":2.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":29,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":14,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":2.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":965754057750171648,"date":1519088684000,"rawContent":"I watched Legally Blonde over the weekend and realized that may have been my first time seeing sexual harassment, someone share their story, get victim blamed and THEN have a friend believe them and empower them! #MeToo","userId":105965228,"media":null,"username":"alisonturkos","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":2.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":29,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":15,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":2.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":965996070168858625,"date":1519146385000,"rawContent":"I can't suggest this incredible mini series from @theheartradio enough. It discusses so much of the gray area we've been talking about in the #MeToo movement. Treat yourself with care as you listen to it, but PLEASE listen to it: https:\/\/t.co\/jkZ23Lzs5L","userId":105965228,"media":null,"username":"alisonturkos","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":3.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":29,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":16,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":3.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":966328652156764160,"date":1519225678000,"rawContent":"First and foremost I want to say I believe you. I trust you. I\u2019m holding you in the light even though I know it may feel like there\u2019s only darkness surrounding you. #MeToo","userId":105965228,"media":null,"username":"alisonturkos","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":4.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":29,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":17,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":4.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":966329019426799618,"date":1519225766000,"rawContent":"Remember, and tell yourself this each and every day: there is not one survivor narrative. There is no such thing as the perfect rape victim. There is not one experience. We are all individuals and have all experienced harm #MeToo","userId":105965228,"media":null,"username":"alisonturkos","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":5.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":29,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":18,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":5.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":966329432129654786,"date":1519225864000,"rawContent":"Unapologetically put yourself first in your healing process. Center yourself and no one else. Only hold those close who will help you do the same. #MeToo","userId":105965228,"media":null,"username":"alisonturkos","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":6.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":29,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":19,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":6.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":966330009668366336,"date":1519226002000,"rawContent":"Invest in yourself. No matter what that looks like, no matter what that feels like. INVEST IN YOUR FUCKING SELF. #MeToo","userId":105965228,"media":null,"username":"alisonturkos","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":7.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":29,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":20,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":7.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":966330308059594752,"date":1519226073000,"rawContent":"Remember that your healing + your safety should always come first, it is #1 - other peoples comfort is a luxury and should come second. #MeToo","userId":105965228,"media":null,"username":"alisonturkos","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":8.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":29,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":21,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":8.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":966330754128113666,"date":1519226179000,"rawContent":"When @virgietovar on @callyrgf said \u201cyou have the right to thrive\u201d those words resonated with me so deeply. Because she's right. And that's what I would tell someone. I would put it on a t-shirt so everyone could see it #MeToo","userId":105965228,"media":null,"username":"alisonturkos","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":9.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":29,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":22,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":9.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":966331092142907392,"date":1519226260000,"rawContent":"It's been said there's no map to healing and that's so true. But if there was it's only you who would hold it and know how to navigate #MeToo","userId":105965228,"media":null,"username":"alisonturkos","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":10.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":29,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":23,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":10.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":966331492115910656,"date":1519226355000,"rawContent":"Each day we try to survive. It looks different for us all, and it looks different on a daily basis. But we are extraordinary for doing it #MeToo","userId":105965228,"media":null,"username":"alisonturkos","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":11.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":29,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":24,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":11.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":966746300367757312,"date":1519325253000,"rawContent":"\"We cannot jail, fire or expel our way out of this crisis. We need institutional responses to sexual harm that prioritize both justice and healing, not one at the expense of the other.\" #MeToo https:\/\/t.co\/5RabrT3ZMf","userId":105965228,"media":null,"username":"alisonturkos","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":12.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":29,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":25,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":12.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":969305200660971520,"date":1519935343000,"rawContent":"She publishes and crowd sources a list of sexual abusers on the @Middlebury campus and nothing happens to the men listed. She is disciplined with a permanent letter in her academic file. This is why survivors don't come forward #MeToo  \nhttps:\/\/t.co\/KaHIek7cg3 #VT @Vermont","userId":105965228,"media":null,"username":"alisonturkos","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":13.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":29,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":26,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":13.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":969571774718410752,"date":1519998899000,"rawContent":".@AshleyJudd says the cost of not speaking up about Harvey Weinstein would have been her own integrity in this @StoryCorps conversation with her friend Ted Klontz #MeToo \nhttps:\/\/t.co\/vmwCh06BqC","userId":105965228,"media":null,"username":"alisonturkos","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":14.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":29,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":27,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":14.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":971502533263970305,"date":1520459228000,"rawContent":"I never want to hear the question of \"why didn't they come forward sooner?\" or \"why aren't you involving the police? Why aren't you reporting?\". Because character assignation is REAL and survivors are rarely, if ever, believed. #MeToo https:\/\/t.co\/VOHBPYMDv9","userId":105965228,"media":null,"username":"alisonturkos","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":14.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":29,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":28,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":14.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":979774620466401280,"date":1522431447000,"rawContent":"I'm interested to hear from other survivors, what have folks in your life said to you? What's been helpful in your healing process? What's been hurtful? #MeToo https:\/\/t.co\/6QIAbZ59uP","userId":105965228,"media":null,"username":"alisonturkos","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":4.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":29,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":29,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":4.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":986209817663549440,"date":1523965718000,"rawContent":"@WNYC the #Metoo movement didn\u2019t begin months ago (as this HS feminism story just indicated). @TaranaBurke founded the movement years ago. \nPs. This story is great! Glad you\u2019re doing it, but wanted to ensure Tarana\u2019s work wasn\u2019t erased","userId":105965228,"media":null,"username":"alisonturkos","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":2.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":29,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":30,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":2.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":986212543340404740,"date":1523966367000,"rawContent":"@katehinds @WNYC @TaranaBurke @GonzalezSarahA It was a great interview! But the story literally said something along the lines of \u201cthe #metoo movement, started last year...\u201d making it seem as if @TaranaBurke\u2019s work never happened","userId":105965228,"media":null,"username":"alisonturkos","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":3.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":29,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":31,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":3.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":988474440857079809,"date":1524505646000,"rawContent":"Tonight in Brooklyn -- Beyond #metoo: Knowing Our Rights &amp; Demanding Accountability\nhttps:\/\/t.co\/9ckoJ5h3eV","userId":105965228,"media":null,"username":"alisonturkos","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":4.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":29,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":32,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":4.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":998983370691563520,"date":1527011170000,"rawContent":"Thank you @DCampoamor for this piece. I've been craving first person narratives from survivors and I'm grateful you're sharing your story and experience. I believe you and appreciate you. #MeToo #TimesUp https:\/\/t.co\/3Qp3dKcaXl","userId":105965228,"media":null,"username":"alisonturkos","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":2.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":29,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":33,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":2.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":1003712640496078848,"date":1528138716000,"rawContent":"Once again here is a SHINING example of the world centering perpetrators and not survivors \/ victims.\nWoody Allen Thinks He \u2018Should Be the Poster Boy for the Me Too Movement\u2019\nhttps:\/\/t.co\/xVRAKvbB0n via @Variety #Metoo","userId":105965228,"media":null,"username":"alisonturkos","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":2.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":29,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":34,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":2.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0}]